OL,3,GNEWSACouncil boss invites PM to planned
OL,4,Aasylum site
OL,5,
OL,6,FNorth Yorkshire Council's leader has
OL,7,Fwritten to the prime minister inviting
OL,8,Fhim to visit the planned asylum centre
OL,9,Fat the former RAF Linton-on-Ouse base.
OL,11,FCarl Les wrote: "I know you are
OL,12,Fcommitted to place-based decision
OL,13,Fmaking. I have lived in North Yorkshire
OL,14,Fall my life and served its people for
OL,15,Fclose to 30 years and I write to invite
OL,16,Fyou personally to join me to listen to
OL,17,Fthe community concerns on this issue
OL,18,Ffirst hand."
OL,20,FThe Home Office has previously said no
OL,21,Ffinal decision has been made on the
OL,22,Fsite's future.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
