OL,3,GNEWSACouncil boss invites PM to planned
OL,4,Aasylum site
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson said: "As part of the
OL,7,Fprocess, we engage with local
OL,8,Fauthorities and police forces to ensure
OL,9,Fthe safety and security of those in the
OL,10,Fsurrounding area."
